@FrenzoAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5143

### Signup
POST {{FrenzoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bhupen",
  "email": "bhupen@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+919876543210",
  "password": "Secret123"
}

### Login (email)
POST {{FrenzoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "bhupen@example.com",
  "password": "Secret123"
}

### Login (username)
POST {{FrenzoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "bhupen",
  "password": "Secret123"
}

### Chatlist (paste login token below)
GET {{FrenzoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/conversations?pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Accept: application/json

### Chatlist next page (cursor = last row UpdatedAt)
GET {{FrenzoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/conversations?pageSize=20&cursor=2026-10-10T12:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Accept: application/json
